# The Gemini model that drafts, and its prices, for the Modal deploy and the local run of
# ai-service (release download and Modal deploy design, The price file). No value is a secret.
#
# Prices are in millionths of a US dollar for one million tokens: the Standard paid tier of the
# Gemini Developer API, text input, and output with thinking tokens included, as the page below
# states them. A cost that ai-service reports is an estimate at list prices, not an invoiced
# charge. Read the page again, and change the date, whenever a value changes.
#
# Format: comment lines, empty lines, and exactly these five NAME=value lines, each once, with no
# space, quote, or $ in a value.
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
LLM_INPUT_PRICE_MICRO_USD_PER_MILLION_TOKENS=300000
LLM_OUTPUT_PRICE_MICRO_USD_PER_MILLION_TOKENS=2500000
LLM_PRICES_SOURCE=https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing#gemini-3.5-flash-lite
LLM_PRICES_READ_ON=2026-11-23
